==Description==
The '''Biologist Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]] by triumphing [[Bathroom Approach]] on the Hard difficulty twice. The second triumph had to be done 64 hours after the first triumph.

The '''Biologist Nametag''' has a dark green to green text nametag with a dark green outline. It has tall grass behind the text. Multiple pieces of grass can be seen falling out of it.

